  "id": "chicken-terrine-with-leeks-and-apricots",
  "name": "Chicken Terrine with Leeks and Apricots",
  "subtitle": "A make-ahead terrine with tender chicken, leeks, and apricots",
  "description": "Chicken cooked with herbs and stock is combined with sautéed leeks, bacon, apricots, and gelatine, then chilled until sliceable. Serve with olive-oil toast.",
